<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's BPA boosts H1 cons net.</title>
<headline>Portugal's BPA boosts H1 cons net.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consolidated results of Banco Portugues do Atlantico (BPA) in the period from January 1 to June 30 1997.</p>
<p>(Values in billion escudos, unless stated otherwise)</p>
<p>Consolidated net profit    6.701 vs 5.459</p>
<p>ROE			   10.2 pct vs 9.0 pct</p>
<p>ROA			    0.4 pct vs 0.4 pct</p>
<p>Total assets		   4,084 vs 3,038</p>
<p>Total deposits		 2,262 vs 2,083</p>
<p>Loans				824 vs 919</p>
<p>Ratio bad loans to total loans 4.5 pct vs 5.4 pct Ratio provisions to total bad loans 103.2 pct vs 98.5 pct.</p>
<p>NOTE: Banco Comercial Portugues bought Banco Portugues do Atlantico in March 1995.</p>
</text>
